notes:
I found three real things for Dec 27 to 30. I found no zoo, aquarium or playground listing I could stand behind. The Biodôme (an indoor ecosystem museum run by Espace pour la vie, which is also an accredited zoo and aquarium) is the closest match. I did not read the operators' own price pages, so I left every price out.

