- **Missing details:** I left out `price` on all three because I did not read it off an operator's page. The Nicolas Noël show also has no time or venue in what I read.
- **Science Centre hours:** the Science Centre's own holiday-hours page that I found was from a past year. That page had Dec 31 closed, which doesn't affect Dec 27 to 30.
- **Not included:** I did not list the Old Port "Panorama Experience – Living Waters" (runs until Dec 31, 2026). Its page gave no age guidance, so I could not say it suits a toddler.
